nce environments.\n\nStep in front of a virtual audience and practice delivering talks, pitches, lectures, or meetings in a safe and controlled setting. Adjust the venue, audience size, and audience behavior to match your needs \u2014 from small supportive groups to large formal settings.\n\nKey features:\n* multiple realistic venues and presentation spaces\n* adjustable audience size and responsiveness\n* support for your own presentation slides\n* speaker notes for structured rehearsal\n* remote and hybrid presentation practice modes\n* dynamic audience behavior powered by AI\n* session feedback to support skill development\n\nWhether you're preparing for a big presentation, overcoming stage nerves, or refining professional communication skills, Virtual Orator gives you the freedom to practice anytime.", "short_description": "Practice public speaking in realistic VR audiences. The right audience at a button click to help build confidence, refine presentations, and improve communication skills with immersive, customizable speaking scenarios."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtualorator.com/app-privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://virtualorator.com/EULA/", "publisher_name": "Virtual Human Technologies s.r.o", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://virtualorator.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_trackin